      "message": "++\n\nI completely glossed over that detail but it\u0027s totally relevant. I attempted to give this its own section of the guide above, explaining why the relationship between those three roles are beneficial and how it helps us write more concise policies.\n\nLet me know if it contains the detail you\u0027re looking for.",
      "parentUuid": "9fdfeff1_7777a9d5",
      "revId": "cc44258f8a67c4fe8c0e8c2a710a9ec7c01f255e",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
